{100}{}{Neal}
{200}{}{You see Neal, the bartender.}
{210}{}{You see a bartender.}
{220}{}{He looks overworked.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{skum pitt is open}
{1020}{}{skump pitt is closed}
{2000}{}{Welcome to the Skum Pitt. What can I do ya for?}
{2010}{}{Nothing, bye.}
{2020}{}{Uh, I'll have a drink.}
{2030}{}{I'm looking for information.}
{2040}{}{What’s that trophy on the shelf?}
{2050}{}{What happened to that trophy you used to have up there?}
{2060}{}{Gaa hnnngh!}
{2070}{}{I've got your urn back for you.}
{3000}{}{Great. Whaddya want?}
{3010}{}{Bye.}
{3020}{}{Nuka-cola, 3 caps.}
{3030}{}{Beer, 5 caps.}
{3040}{}{The hard stuff, 20 caps.}
{4000}{}{Come back when you've got some money.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{Come back when you've got some money.}
{5010}{}{[Done.]}
{6000}{}{Come back when you've got some money.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Okay, so whaddya wanna know?}
{7010}{}{Nothing else, see you around.}
{7020}{}{What's the scoop on this town?}
{7030}{}{Who's the dangerous-looking stranger in the corner?}
{7040}{}{Who're the jerks?}
{8000}{}{Well, just over there to the west of us is Gizmo's casino. I'd be surprised if you didn't know about it; most of the people here are the ones who just finished losing
their money there. Over in the other part of town you got Killian's general store, and Marcelles's Crash House. Killian's a good guy, runs a straight joint, carries everything you need. The Crash House is where you sleep it off when you've been in here for too long. [Neal chuckles.]}
{8010}{}{Thanks. Can I get a drink?}
{8020}{}{Thanks for the information. See you around.}
{9000}{}{Anything else?}
{9010}{}{Yeah, I'll have a drink.}
{9020}{}{Looking for some more information.}
{9030}{}{No thanks.}
{10000}{}{Fella's called Tycho. Apparently a ranger from back east or something. Pretty nasty fighter, from what I hear, but a straight-up character.}
{10010}{}{Bye.}
{10020}{}{Mind if I ask some other questions?}
{11000}{}{Oh, them. They're the Skulz. They're a local gang. All the riff-raff. Sometimes they start fights or cause a little trouble. Usually Killian keeps them in line, though.}
{11010}{}{Bye.}
{11020}{}{Mind if I ask some other questions?}
{12000}{}{That's not a trophy, it's an urn. It contains my wife's ashes - besides this bar, it is the most important thing in my life.}
{12010}{}{Oh.}
{13000}{}{Thank you. You can't know what this means to me. You'll never pay for a drink in this bar again.}
{13010}{}{[Done.]}
{14000}{}{Some slime stole it. It wasn't a trophy, it was an urn. It contained my wife's ashes - besides this bar, it was the most important thing in my life.
}
{14010}{}{Ok, bye.}
{15000}{}{Bar is closed, leave now!}
{15010}{}{Ok, bye.}
